  "title": "Pipeline and Animal Health Clinical Trials - Vetigenics",
  "text": "Pipeline and Animal Health Clinical Trials - Vetigenics\nSkip to content\nPipeline and Clinical Trials\nPipeline and Clinical Trials\nVetigenics has a promising pipeline of products targeting common diseases in pets. With a strong focus on research and development as well as a commitment to advancing novel therapies through veterinary clinical trials, Vetigenics is well-positioned to tackle a wide range of challenges in the pet health industry.\nExplore Details About our Clinical Trials:\nCTLA4 (VGS-001) Trial – Canine Oral Melanoma, visit:\nNorth Carolina State University – Closed\nUniversity of Missouri – Closed\nPD-1 (VGS-002) Trial – Canine Urothelial Carcinoma, visit:\nEthos Veterinary Health – Closed\nBridge Animal Referral Center (BARC) – Closed\nCTLA4 + PD-1 Combination Immunotherapy Trial (CHECKMATE-K9), visit:\nFully Enrolled\nUniversity of Wisconsin – Closed\nBridge Animal Referral Center (BARC) – Closed\nUniversity of Illinois – Closed\nTufts University – Closed\nUniversity of Missouri – Closed\nTo learn more or inquire about eligibility, please contact us\nLocation Map\nHome\nCompany & Leadership\nTechnology & Pipeline\nPartners for Pet Health\nTranslational Research\nNews\nVideos and Publications\nCareers\nBlog\nContact Us\nHome\nCompany & Leadership\nTechnology & Pipeline\nPartners for Pet Health\nTranslational Research\nNews\nVideos and Publications\nCareers\nBlog\nContact Us\nCopyrights © 2026. All Rights Reserved by Vetigenics |\nSitemap\n|\nPrivacy Policy\n|\nTerms of Use\nWebsite by Axxiem\nHome\nCompany & Leadership\nOur Mission\nBoard of Directors\nLeadership Team\nTechnology & Pipeline\nCANIBODY™ Platform\nCANIBODY™ Discovery Process\nPipeline and Clinical Trials\nPartners for Pet Health\nWays We Can Work With You​\nPartnerships: Track Record Of Success\nExisting Partners\nTranslational Research\nNews\nVideos and Publications\nCareers\nBlog\nContact Us\nHamburger Toggle Menu\nShare this page\nFacebook\nTwitter\nLinkedIn\nEmail\n.ele